  <h2 class="display-md reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">One team, so that everything fits in time</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">At a trade fair, the date is not negotiable. Every coordination loop between agency, film production and printer costs days that are missing at the end. Here, concept, copy, design and video sit in the same team — decision paths stay short, and the parts fit together because they come from the same message.</p>
</section>

